    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d711">

                <pb facs="0968" n="898" sameAs="frus:frus1862/pg898"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Dickinson.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 24.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-10-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 6, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Your despatches of September 12 and 15
                    (Nos. 27 and 29) have been received. Your proceedings in assuring the government
                    of Nicaragua that its objection to the colonization of Americans of African
                    derivation within the limit of that republic will be respected are approved.</p>
                <p>I give you, for your better information, copies of the correspondence on that
                    subject, which has taken place here between his excellency Mr. Molina and this
                    department, and a copy of my letter to the Secretary of the Interior on the same
                    subject.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. B. Dickinson,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c. Nicaragua.</hi></p>
                    <p rendition="#center">[Enclosures with No. 24.]</p>
                    <p>Mr. Molina to Mr. Seward, September 19, 1862.</p>
                    <p>Mr. Seward to Mr. Molina, September 24, 1862.</p>
                    <p>Mr. Molina to Mr. Seward, September 29, 1862.</p>
                    <p>Mr. Seward to Mr. Molina, October 1, 1862.</p>
                    <p>Mr. Seward to Mr. Smith, October 6, 1862.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
